# Test fixtures are the exception to the rules above, and have to be committed
# or the golden test only runs on the machine that produced it. Both are
# derived from real data with everything identifying removed: the CSV keeps
# only the columns the parser reads (dates, messages, amounts) and carries
# placeholder sender numbers and names, and the config is the real routing
# table with a placeholder attestation.
!report/testdata/swish.csv
!report/testdata/config.yaml
